> dungeon levels (8 mines, ~3 main dungeon) alltogether and had
> already ~20 spellbooks. Now proceeded beyond Medusa and still
> collecting more books. What shall I do with those books? Sigh.

I don't know, most of them will be useless to you indeed. Personally,
I would identify them first (even if only by price), then bless and
read those that could be useful with the right equipment later, mostly
low-level utility spells. Identify or Remove Curse, for example.

Wearing a robe, an enchanted helm of brilliance and no metallic armor,
even barbarians can get a decent enough failure rate with unskilled
level 3 spells (around 50%). For utility spells like the
aforementioned Identify or Remove Curse, finding a safe spot and
changing your equipment to actually cast the spell isn't that bad
either.

